  "description": "Sa-Rang Jin is one of the most famous actresses in South Korea, and she has it all—talent, good looks, and a loving fiancé... or not! One week before their wedding, her groom-to-be ghosts her. She desperately searches everywhere for In-Ha, only to discover he’s lied to her throughout their entire relationship. To her dismay, his secret triggers her own personal misfortunes with shamanism. Heartbroken and traumatized by her past, will she be able to accept him for who he is? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
